<BaseLayout title="About Gamepad Tester" description="Learn how Gamepad Tester reads controller input locally through the browser Gamepad API."><section class="article-hero"><div class="shell article-hero-inner"><span class="subpage-kicker">ABOUT THE TOOL</span><h1>Simple diagnostics.<br /><span>Clear signals.</span></h1><p class="lede">Gamepad Tester is a static browser tool for checking the inputs exposed by your controller and browser.</p></div></section><section class="subpage-content shell"><article class="info-card"><h2>Local by design</h2><p>The page reads controller data in your browser through the standard Gamepad API. There is no account, download or controller data upload in the MVP.</p></article><article class="info-card"><h2>Transparent limits</h2><p>Browser support varies by operating system, connection type, controller and browser. The tool shows what the API reports instead of pretending to be a hardware lab.</p></article></section></BaseLayout>
